{
  "about": "Which links the dashboard's window keeps, what Back does there, and what \"Back to Nouride Home\" does. See spec/link-policy.md. `origin` is the Nouride the window shows: this device's own (http on the loopback) or another machine's (https). A case's `expect` is both apps' answer; `android` or `desktop`, when present, is that app's own answer where the two differ today.",
  "home": "nouridehome://home",
  "page_back": "nouridehome://back",
  "user_agent_mark": "NourideHome/2",
